WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:06.698
Change Source sets the source to Manual or Automatic.

00:00:06.698 --> 00:00:11.144
It also has an Interaction type selector, to keep the current type or

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.515
make the work manual or automated.

00:00:13.515 --> 00:00:17.961
By default it clears the assignment, so the work can be routed again.

00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:23.124
Purge marks the activities purged with your name and the time, and it

00:00:23.124 --> 00:00:26.642
cannot be undone, so it asks you to confirm first.

